    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition of supply and acquisition";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "a reference to the supply or acquisition of goods includes a reference to the supply or acquisition of goods together with other property or services, or both";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The definition is equal to combined supply and acquisition";
