    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the person’s failure to supply all the goods or services within the period, or within a reasonable time, was due to the act or omission of another person, or to some other cause beyond the person’s control;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(b) the person took reasonable precautions and exercised due diligence to avoid the failure.";
