    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Inducing a consumer to acquire goods or services by representing a rebate, commission, or other benefit in return for assisting others is prohibited.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>;
