    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-2-sec-167-2-ss-1-norm>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-2-sec-167-2-ss-1-norm> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/Prohibition>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
