    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "consider";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Consider conduct of person and non-party consumers in relation to contravening conduct when determining whether to make an order under section 239(1)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(a), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct, since the contravention occurred.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(a), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct, since the contravention occurred.";
