    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Manufacturer has an obligation to indemnify supplier.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier is liable to pay damages under section 259(4) to the consumer for loss or damage suffered by the consumer; and  (b) the manufacturer is or would be liable under section 271 to pay damages to the consumer for the same loss or damage.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier is liable to pay damages under section 259(4) to the consumer for loss or damage suffered by the consumer; and  (b) the manufacturer is or would be liable under section 271 to pay damages to the consumer for the same loss or damage.";
